size:10pt;">- Bedeckung, opt.: 100 %</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Leiterisolationsmaterial: Foam / Skin-PE</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Leiterisolation Ø: 5,70 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Leiterisolation Ø: 0.2244 &#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Gewicht bei 1 m: 76.93 g</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Brandlast je m: 0,22 kWh</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Bauform: rund</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Aufmachung, VPE: als Meterware</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Verkürzungsfaktor: 0,84</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Temperatur min.: -10 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Temperatur max.: 80 °C</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Max. Übertragungslänge (SMPTE 425M, 3G) (ohne Steckverbinder): 199 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Max. Übertragungslänge (SMPTE 425M, 3G) (ohne Steckverbinder): 652.8872 ft</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Max. Übertragungslänge (SMPTE 2081, 6G) (ohne Steckverbinder): 134 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Max. Übertragungslänge (SMPTE 2081, 6G) (ohne Steckverbinder): 439.6326 ft</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Max. Übertragungslänge (SMPTE 2082, 12G) (ohne Steckverbinder): 94 m</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Max. Übertragungslänge (SMPTE 2082, 12G) (ohne Steckverbinder): 308,399 ft</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Breite: 8,1 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Breite: 0.3189 &#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Höhe: 8,1 mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Höhe: 0.3189 &#x22;</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Kapazität Ader/Schirm bei 1m (Video): 53 pF</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Kapazität Ader/Schirm bei 1 ft. (Video): 16.1544 pF</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 5 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 1,2 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 5 MHz (100 ft. &#x26; 20 °C / 68 °F): 0.3658 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 50 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 3,5 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 50 MHz (100 ft. &#x26; 20 °C / 68 °F): 1.0668 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 100 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 4,8 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 100 MHz (100 ft. &#x26; 20 °C / 68 °F): 1.463 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 1000 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 16,1 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 1000 MHz (100 ft. &#x26; 20 °C / 68 °F): 4.9073 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 1485 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 20,1 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 1485 MHz (100 ft. &#x26; 20 °C / 68 °F): 6.1265 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 2150 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 25,3 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 2150 MHz (100 ft. &#x26; 20 °C / 68 °F): 7.7114 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 3000 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 29,8 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 3000 MHz (100 ft. &#x26; 20 °C / 68 °F): 9.083 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Dämpfung bei 6000 MHz (100m &#x26; 20° C): 42,7 dB</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Wellenwiderstand: 75 O</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Leiterwiderstand bei 1 km: 13 O</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Leiterwiderstand bei 1000 ft.: 3.9624 O</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Schirmwiderstand bei 1 km: 6,2 O</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- Schirmwiderstand bei 1000 ft.: 1.8898 O</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">- BPVo-Euroklasse: Eca</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Video-Koaxialkabel 1,3/5,7 Doppelmantel 75Ohm 12G</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item><Item ID="id148" RNoPart="3"><Qty>100.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><UP>1.690</UP><TimeQu>0.06</TimeQu><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Installationsleitung mit verbessertem Verhal-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">ten im Brandfall für Innenrauminstalla-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">tion in besonders gefährdeten Brandab-</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">schnitten, gemäß VDE 0266. Arbeitshöhe Max 4 Meter. </span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:405pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Installationsleitung NHXMH 3x2,5 halogenfrei </span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody><Totals><Total>1107.00</Total></Totals></BoQCtgy></BoQBody><Totals><Total>1107.00</Total><TotalGross>1317.33</TotalGross></Totals></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id149" RNoPart="09"><LblTx><p><span>Tragsysteme</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><BoQCtgy ID="id150" RNoPart="01"><LblTx><p><span>Kabelrinnen</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Remark ID="id151"><Description><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kabelrinnen aus verzinktem Stahlblech nach DIN 17162 (FS) mit gelochtem oder gesicktem Boden, Prägung für gratfreie Kabelauflage, Seiten oben mit eingerollten Kanten zur Verstärkung und als Kabelschutz.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Blechdicke = 0,75mm</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Rinnenstöße verschraubt als Potentialausgleich nach VDE mit Flachrundschrauben und beigelegter Fächerscheibe nach DIN 6798.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Nach Montageabschluss sind Schnitt- und Schadstellen mit Zinkstaubfarbe nachzuverzinken.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die vertikalen Stiele sind je nach Belastung als T-, U- oder I-Stiele, feuerverzinkt nach DIN 5076 (FT) vorzusehen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Alle Stiele erhalten an ihrer Unterseite eine Schutzkappe zu Unfallverhütung aus gelbem Kunststoff.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Der Regelabhänge- und Auslegerabstand beträgt 1,5m. In Abhängigkeit von der baulichen Situation kann es erforderlich sein diesen Regelabstand zu variieren. Die zulässigen statischen Belastungen der Rinnen dürfen jedoch nicht überschritten werden.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Eine Abhängung der Rinnen über beidseitige oder mittige Pendelstangen bedarf der Absprache mit der Bauleitung. Sie kann bei großen Rinnenbreiten aus statischen Gründen erforderlich werden.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Preisstellung:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Einheitspreise der nachstehend anzubietenden Rinnen verstehen sich als komplettes Installationssystem, inkl. aller erforderlichen Abhängungen, Hängestiele, Ausleger, Tragkonstruktionen, Verbinder, Gelenke, Abzweige und Bögen und sonstigem Montagezubehör.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Abhängehöhe wird auf max. 1,5 m Stiellänge begrenzt.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"/><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Befestigung und Montage:</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Je nach baulicher Situation kann die Befestigung an aufgehendem Mauerwerk, an Betonwänden, Stahlbetondecken oder an Stahlkonstruktionen erfolgen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Befestigungselemente sind entsprechend der angetroffenen Montagesituation zu wählen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">In Frage kommen können hierbei Kopfplatten mit Stahldübelbefestigung, Klemmbefestigung etc.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Dübelbefestigung hat mit zugelassenen Dübeln zu erfolgen. Die zulässigen Lasten für Dübel in der Zugzone sind zu beachten.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Zeugnisse für die bauaufsichtliche Zulassung sind bei der Abnahme mit vorzulegen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">An Stahlkonstruktionen soll das Kabelrinnensystem bevorzugt geklemmt werden.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Die Befestigung hat auch hier unter Berücksichtigung des erforderlichen Potentialausgleichs zu erfolgen.</span></p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;width:284pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Im Zweifel ist die Wahl der Befestigungselemente hierzu mit dem Fachplaner abzustimmen.</span></p></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Vortext zu Kabelrinnensystemen:</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Remark><Item ID="id152" RNoPart="1"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><UP>54.000</UP><TimeQu>0.21</TimeQu><Description><STLBBau><STLBBauCtlg><CtlgName>STLB-Bau</CtlgName><VersDate>2020-10</VersDate><WCtg>053</WCtg><Group>3278</Group></STLBBauCtlg><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>10435</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>222</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>6490</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>72</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>2163</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>6</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11894</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>2</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>6516</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>11</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11905</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>2</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>3054</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>124</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>8016</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>8</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11892</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>3</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11891</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>1</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>9122</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>15</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>10164</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>1</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>2136</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>2</ChVIdent></STLBBauID></STLBBau><CompleteText><DetailTxt><Text><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kabelrinne für Kabelträgersystem DIN EN 61537 (VDE 0639), gelocht, mit einem Trennsteg, aus bandverzinktem Stahl DIN EN 10346, Seitenhöhe mind. 60 mm, Breite mind. 100 mm, Arbeitshöhe bis 4 m.</span></Text></DetailTxt><OutlineText><OutlTxt><TextOutlTxt><p style="width:481pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;">Kabelrinne Stahl bandverz H 60mm B 100mm</span></p></TextOutlTxt></OutlTxt></OutlineText></CompleteText></Description></Item></Itemlist></BoQBody><Totals><Total>540.00</Total></Totals></BoQCtgy><BoQCtgy ID="id153" RNoPart="03"><LblTx><p><span>StaPa Rohre</span></p></LblTx><BoQBody><Itemlist><Item ID="id154" RNoPart="10"><Qty>10.000</Qty><QU>m</QU><UP>14.380</UP><Description><STLBBau><STLBBauCtlg><CtlgName>STLB-Bau</CtlgName><VersDate>2021-04</VersDate><WCtg>053</WCtg><Group>3275</Group></STLBBauCtlg><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>10435</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>205</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11905</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>10</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11267</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>2</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>9731</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>7</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>23127</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>4</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11271</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>4</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11272</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>6</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>11910</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>8</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>10617</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>29</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>2163</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>6</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>9122</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>10</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>10164</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>1</ChVIdent></STLBBauID><STLBBauID><ArtChrIdent>2136</ArtChrIdent><ArtChIdx>0</ArtChIdx><ChVIdent>2</ChVIdent></STLBBa